# Build output. The leading slash targets the compiled binary at the repo root.
/auditlight
# ...but a bare `/auditlight` would also silently ignore a directory of the same
# name if one is ever added at the root, which has bitten this line of products
# before: git quietly drops every NEW file inside it while tracked files keep
# working, so the repo only breaks for whoever clones it next. Re-include it.
!/auditlight/

# Local job data and scratch
/.auditlight/
*.tar.gz
SHA256SUMS

# Seller kit — must never reach a public repository
issuer.key
RELEASE.md
